# IMP identity

IMP is the whole Integrated Market Platform: opportunity discovery, evidence,
portfolio/risk, governed Paper, monitoring, and operator workflow.

IMP is not:

- ES or any single instrument
- FTEP (the protocol, not the product)
- V1-001 / V1-002 (campaigns)
- one strategy family, data provider, or interface

Edit only `projects/integrated-market-platform/`. Do not edit the leftover
nested `integrated-market-platform/` clone.

Doctrine: `docs/architecture/IMP_SCOPE_FTEP_PAPER_VALIDATION_DOCTRINE.md`.
Operating index: `docs/engineering/AGENT_OPERATING_SYSTEM.md`.
